    "bio": {
      "overview": "John Myung is a founding member of Dream Theater, renowned for his technical bass playing and integral role in shaping the band's progressive metal sound.",
      "extended_bio": [
        "Born in Chicago, Illinois, to Korean parents, Myung grew up in Kings Park, Long Island, New York.",
        "Co-founded Dream Theater at Berklee College of Music in 1985 with John Petrucci and Mike Portnoy.",
        "Known for his virtuosic playing style and use of extended-range basses in progressive metal."
